
.subckt astra_067_mos_common_gate_colpitts_oscillator vdd VSS vg vb tank fb out
C1 tank fb 10p
C2 fb VSS 20p
CL out VSS 100f
L1 net0 tank 1u
M1 tank vg fb VSS ANMOS l=1u w=50u
M2 fb vb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M3 vdd tank out VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 out vb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=2u
RS vdd net0 10
.ends astra_067_mos_common_gate_colpitts_oscillator
